  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 2003.08 Initial Voluntary Certification: Issuance and Duration.\n\n(a) Initial certifications shall be issued in accordance with Plc 304.11.\n\n(b) Initial certifications shall be valid as provided in Plc 304.12.\n\nSource. #14217, INTERIM, eff 4-1-25; ss by #14388, eff 10-24-25, EXPIRES: 10-24-35 (formerly Plc 2003.06)",
